        <Text>Research Question 4 (RQ4): Is there a connection between the college type (i.e. Division 1 college, Division 2 college, etc.) the player attended, if any, and the number of seasons they play?
Hypothesis 4 (H4): There is a connection between the colleges they play and number of the seasons of a player. Different colleges impact different quality of baseball knowledge on potential baseball players, and therefore there is a connection between the college a player attends and the number of seasons they play.
</Text>
